    "description" : {
      "en" : "The ten battery chemistry terms prescribed by the draft labelling Implementing Act under Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, as listed in BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List v1.3, attribute 39. Declared as individuals of the cross-sectoral class dpp:MaterialType of the CORE MAT module and reached through the inherited dpp:hasMaterialType. Replaces the free-text chemistry names of the battery-materials module."
    },
    "labels" : {
      "en" : "EU DPP Battery Chemistries Vocabulary"
    },
